     question this fixture asks is about the DOCUMENT, not about this port:
     section 9.1 says the island is organised "following the declarative
     RT-configuration approach already demonstrated (contract facts -> priority
     bands, `chain_aware` mapper)", so this feeds that mapper the document's own
     facts and reads back the order it produces.

