     places in a partition (I4 and I17/I18 are excluded by the design itself -
     I4 is header-only, I17/I18 are the legacy path), the 20 new island nodes of
     sections 6.1 to 6.4, and section 9.1's unnamed "telemetry egress" in P4. -->
